title: mf repo compact
tags: [[CLI command]] Storage
kind: reference
summary: Rewrite the selected repository's store without its free pages

Gives back to the disk the pages a large import or deletion freed: the store is
copied without them, the copy checked, then put in its place; prints the file's size
before and after. The repository waits for it to finish; refused while it is held in
memory ([[Compacting a repository]]).
